     "pregunta": {
      "texto": "What's the fundamental difference between «liegen» and «legen»?",
      "lengua": "alumno"
     },
     "frase": {
      "texto": "",
      "lengua": "alumno"
     },
     "traduccion": "",
     "audio": "",
     "oir_frase": false,
     "opciones": [
      {
       "texto": "«Liegen» describes a static position (Wo? + Dativ), while «legen» indicates the action of placing (Wohin? + Akkusativ).",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "«Liegen» is intransitive with the dative; «legen» is transitive with the accusative.",
       "correcta": true
      },
      {
       "texto": "«Liegen» is used only for living people, and «legen» only for plants.",
